@startuml
title Milestone 3B - proposed collection and DRC lifecycle
[*] --> PENDING_DRC : completed execution + authorized weighed lot
PENDING_DRC : dry mass = null
PENDING_DRC --> PENDING_DRC : manager-approved weight/time correction
PENDING_DRC --> CALCULATED : first DRC by supervisor/management
PENDING_DRC --> CALCULATED : manager correction supplies measurement
CALCULATED : measured DRC, derived dry mass
CALCULATED --> CALCULATED : manager correction / recalculate
PENDING_DRC --> VOIDED : manager reasoned void
CALCULATED --> VOIDED : manager reasoned void
VOIDED : retain evidence; current summary contribution = 0
VOIDED --> [*]
note right of CALCULATED
Zero measured DRC is valid.
Replacement appends a measurement.
No in-place observation overwrite.
end note
note bottom of PENDING_DRC
Initial creation does not include DRC.
Every mutation needs Idempotency-Key.
Non-create command needs observed version.
Exact replay returns original receipt without a transition.
end note
@enduml
